  the board as written (no plane, the strip held at 0 V): n_eff 1.5554, Z0 26.37 ohm, share 0.754, Q_d 66.3, Q_c 80.3, Q 36.3; m = 1 takes 210.6 mm (section 3.6's estimate sqrt((1 + er)/2) = 1.6432: 199.4 mm); its null 0.564 mm up, gradient 1.062 of ELE-1's
