  lever, the board RO4003C 1.524 mm (er 3.55, tan d 0.0027): n_eff 1.5230, Z0 23.34 ohm, Q_d 468, Q_c 93.6, Q 78.0: R 290 ohm, 50 V takes 4.3 W
